	"data": "Nextcloud\n\nSelf-hosted cloud platform running in production on Optiplex (Docker container, behind Caddy reverse proxy at cloud.cybernautics.net). Migrated from Pi5 to Optiplex on 2026-04-15 alongside Caddy, Grafana, Prometheus, and other web services.\n\nHost: Optiplex (100.96.169.9 Tailscale, 192.168.1.228 LAN)\nURL: cloud.cybernautics.net (Cloudflare proxy → Caddy → Nextcloud)\nStorage: /mnt/storage/ on Optiplex\nDatabase: MariaDB (per service-map)\nBackup: Restic daily 2am — script + DB dump, 7…",
